  "description": "OS keyring variable source for Bowire (#208 Phase 5). Resolves {{keyring.service/account}} placeholders against the platform credential store — Windows Credential Manager (CredRead), macOS Keychain (security), and libsecret (secret-tool) — so secrets never live in workspace files, environment exports, or shared collections. Dependency-free: the platform bindings are native P/Invoke plus CLI shell-out, no NuGet. Opt-in by construction (only present if the host references the package) and never egresses — the store read is local and only fires when a template explicitly references a keyring ref. Same optional-package shape as the AI + protocol plugins.",
